I go to the metro station.
I have the ticket with me.
Now I know the way well.
I wait for the metro.
Soon, the metro arrives.
I enter the train.
Inside it is air-conditioned, so it is very cool.
I sit on a seat.
I look outside from the window.
The scenery changes quickly.
I look at the small box of sweets in my bag.
I will go to Priya's house tonight.
'We will talk a lot,' I think.
At the office, she is a good colleague.
But now we will be friends outside the office too.
'Let's have fun tonight,' I think.
I am very happy.
Soon, the destination station will arrive.
